Export the public headers

The library's sources include its public headers by relative path, so a
library built from the module's source filegroups needs those headers among
its inputs, and the module's BUILD file keeps them private.

The patch adds two lines to the module's BUILD file and carries the six
around them, too little of the file to attribute.

License: Apache-2.0 (Bazel Central Registry overlay of zstd 1.5.7.bcr.1)

--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@
 
 exports_files(["LICENSE"])
 
+exports_files(["lib/zstd.h", "lib/zstd_errors.h"])
+
 filegroup(
     name = "common_sources",
     srcs = glob([
